<title>HONG KONG: Universal Robina prices US$100 mln bond.</title>
<headline>Universal Robina prices US$100 mln bond.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following pricing details for Universal Robina Corp's guaranteed notes issue was announced by bookrunner Merrill Lynch Far East on Friday.</p>
<p> BORROWER   UNIVERSAL ROBINA (CAYMAN) LTD</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  UNIVERSAL ROBINA CORPORATION</p>
<p> AMOUNT     US$100 MLN  COUPON   *8.375 PCT MATURITY  19.DEC.06</p>
<p> TYPE    EUROBOND+144A  ISS PRICE  PAR	RE-OFFER  PAR</p>
<p> PUTS	 NONE	  CALLS	NONE     LAUNCH    11.DEC.96</p>
<p> LISTING    LUXEMBOURG  RATING     NONE     DENOMS    **</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	   CRS DEF    YES	FORCE MAJ IPMA2</p>
<p> HOME CTRY  PHILIPPINES GOV LAW    NEW YORK PAY DATE  19.DEC.96</p>
<p> FEES	 87.5BP AS   MGT/UND    37.5BP   SELL CONC 50BP</p>
<p> PAY FREQ   SEMI-ANNUALLY</p>
<p> BOOKRUNNER    MERRILL LYNCH FAR EAST</p>
<p> CO-MANAGERS   CHASE MANHATTAN INTERNATIONAL, DRESDNER BANK HONG</p>
<p>		   KONG BRANCH AND SBC WARBURG</p>
<p> NOTES	   *TO YIELD 8.375 PCT OR SPREAD 200BP OVER THE U.S.</p>
<p>		    TREASURY 6.5 PCT DUE OCTOBER 15, 2006</p>
<p>		  **DENOMINATIONS AT US$1K AND INTEGRAL MUTIPLES</p>
<p>		    THEREOF ON REG S, US$250K+US$1K ON 144A</p>
<p>		 ***THE ISSUE WILL FREE TO TRADE AT 11.00 AM HONG</p>
<p>		    KONG TIME.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6960</p>
</text>
